{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、BAD BOYS J―最後に守るもの―"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が公開されましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿でまいやんななみいこまの４人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台挨拶があり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"池袋では若月あみみれかたんまなつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"含めた８人で舞台挨拶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそれぞれで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お出迎えハイタッチと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見送りハイタッチをさせていただきましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチを通して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直に皆さんの声を聞けたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちを伝えることができて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったですヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台挨拶は日本テレビアナウンサーの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青木さんの進行で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の裏話とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が男やったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのキャラがいいかとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山お話しましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短い時間でしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TOHOシネマズ六本木ヒルズで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャストの皆さんと窪田監督と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日舞台挨拶がありましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この映画は自信を持って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に面白い作品だと言えます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＢＢＪに出てくる男の子達は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のプライドや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な人を守る為に戦っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうのは凄く素敵やなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非とも女性の方は勿論ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性の方に見てほしい映画です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱い友情もあり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり恋愛もありますヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６のメンバーも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"銀幕デビューということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく気合いが入っています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＢＡＤBOYSＪを皆さんと一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上げていきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な人と、泣きたかったら一人でも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も何回も観てほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしまっちゅんヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/11/11/9759833/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}